        "x1": 0.8792173098894506,
        "y1": 0.6263637735386087
      },
      "text": "and 0.5, which are labeled GS and SD minima, respectively, because the GCM results show",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
