        "y0": 0.6376320810029001,
        "x1": 0.8794124827665442,
        "y1": 0.6527270307444563
      },
      "text": "that these minima correspond to the GS and the SD states, respectively, as explained later.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
